---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { withSiteName } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title={withSiteName('Cookie Settings')} description="Choose whether this guide may use Google Analytics." path="/cookies/"><section class="section"><div class="wrap prose max-w-4xl"><p class="eyebrow">Your privacy</p><h1 class="serif text-5xl font-bold">Cookie Settings</h1><p>Updated 20 October 2026. Analytics is off until you choose to enable it. You can withdraw or grant consent here without reloading.</p><form id="cookie-form" class="card p-7"><label class="consent-choice"><input id="analytics" class="toggle" type="checkbox" /> Allow Google Analytics</label><p>Optional analytics helps us understand visits. Advertising features are disabled. Necessary browser storage remembers this choice; weather may cache recent conditions in this tab for 30 minutes.</p><button class="choice-button" type="submit">Save choice</button> <button class="choice-button" id="reject-all" type="button">Reject analytics</button><p id="saved" role="status"></p></form><p>If storage is blocked, your choice applies immediately but may not survive a new tab or browser. A denial is kept in this tab where possible. An old stored grant will not load analytics when preference storage cannot be written.</p><h2>Other external services</h2><p>The Google Maps embed and Open-Meteo weather requests operate separately from analytics. Loading them sends ordinary request details to their providers. This guide has no advertising, account, booking or contact form.</p><a class="link" href="/privacy/">Read the privacy policy</a></div></section></BaseLayout>
